Objective:
To build an end-to-end Azure Data Pipeline using Azure Blob Storage and Azure Data Factory.

Tasks Performed:
• Created Resource Group.
• Created Storage Account and Blob Containers.
• Uploaded Superstore CSV file.
• Created Azure Data Factory.
• Configured Linked Services and Datasets.
• Used Get Metadata activity for file validation.
• Built a Copy Data pipeline.
• Executed and monitored pipeline runs.
• Configured IAM roles between ADF and Storage.

Result:
The pipeline successfully copied the Superstore CSV file from the source Blob container to the destination Blob container. Metadata validation and monitoring confirmed successful execution.
